{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2a685da2d97f502d8987fb5a410a395a08bc43686b44d7d16eee7f0db75064e2", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』の稽古が始まった。けど、\n台本を渡してから、海美の元気がない気がする）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》的排练开始了。不过，把剧本交给海美之后，她好像就没什么精神了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1001_p", "source_sha256": "1a11592bf1d05655000f210b4543cbbe956747ff58a718a93bc0ad6dad8fffc5", "ja": "お疲れ様、海美。\n少し、話したいんだけど……。", "zh": "辛苦了，海美。\n我有点事想和你聊聊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1002_029umi", "source_sha256": "6260e956f342c012be69ef891a9d4f08da09bfa8809636b073b2929328ec0780", "ja": "うう～……。\nなんかなんか……モヤモヤする～！", "zh": "呜呜～……。\n总觉得总觉得……心里好憋屈啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1003_p", "source_sha256": "be23c531bdee868dc200b0db6ee58c91c64ca807fdbc56e35887c9d19fec6844", "ja": "わっ！？", "zh": "哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1004_029umi", "source_sha256": "3f7f30ae543ac8df8aff075fc51bf9dfd603706b45224ee1883f894cbbf5f47e", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}！？\nどうしたの、そんなに驚いて……？", "zh": "诶，{$P$}！？\n怎么了，干吗这么惊讶……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1005_p", "source_sha256": "90215b012f9c396ee1eebe5d42d41f8f36ec03740a49cb1c8b5cf271d0832d87", "ja": "いや、それはこっちの台詞なんだけど……。\n海美が悩んでるみたいだから、気になって。", "zh": "不，这话应该我说才对吧……\n看海美好像在烦恼什么，我有点在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "86e5e88ecd839ed52d3113f1f509c6f14ba0de8edb6959bfa753d019415c5d8e", "ja": "あっ、ごめーん！\n私、そんなに顔に出てた？　えへへ。", "zh": "啊，抱歉——！\n我表现得那么明显吗？嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "a0cc463decbb12a3d579d7f1525b9902ed284e89e2e58f201e23594910ed336a", "ja": "あのさ、{$P$}に\n聞きたいんだけど……。", "zh": "那个，我想问问{$P$}……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "91d2ad2ac505a31251cfb9bcfb157b2e5e1a317b005fb386dd9d75aa14602dc3", "ja": "自分は一生懸命がんばってるんだけど、それでも\n相手とすれ違っちゃう時って、どうしたらいいかな？", "zh": "明明自己已经很努力了，可有时候还是会和对方产生分歧，这种时候该怎么办才好呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bfc5f53261428e68daf8cd43f8b4433b9ce731858aaa37ac06c9d692a0123f3a", "ja": "すれ違う……今回のお芝居の話か？", "zh": "“产生分歧……你是说这次演出的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "84c844895cbd448e0843995fbb533afa7992b044d84195ccae65c80abf21cfbd", "ja": "うーん？\nお芝居のことっていえば、そうなのかも……？", "zh": "嗯——？\n要说是戏剧的事，也许确实是这样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "a5ef6696fee526e79809f021d46dd2eb7ba35c37c22cfa66105865439d102bbe", "ja": "自分ががんばればがんばるほど、\nがっかりする人や、悲しむ人がいたりするでしょ？", "zh": "自己越努力，就越会有人感到失望、感到难过，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "be0388f4144e12805f9d91fba4229eef98b9ed790a296a6053b78e48ab27f2ea", "ja": "そうじゃなくて……みんなで、\nなんかいい感じになれないのかなぁって。", "zh": "不是那样……我是想，大家能不能一起变得更好呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1013_p", "source_sha256": "6605c76e3b1ba177448cc1b43c8267a0bd53d30785c7320eac652d492eeda398", "ja": "そうだな……。海美が考えているようにするのは、\n正直難しいかもしれないな。", "zh": "是啊……想要像海美所设想的那样，老实说可能有点困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1014_p", "source_sha256": "43b59da99831d83b7d497b76bb07f00824844f5c2968d5217f17c5a6af97cfbf", "ja": "どうあれ、みんな同じ評価を受けるなら、\n努力しなくても良くなる……というか。", "zh": "不管怎样，如果大家得到的评价都一样，那就算不努力也能变好……该说是这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "cd1e743720fde92e8aa52dd6ff64bde1e659cb718c742d2eefb474e5391cb8ce", "ja": "そっか。それって、私……ううん、\n織姫がもっともっとがんばっても、無理なのかな？", "zh": "这样啊。那样的话，我……不对，\n就算织姬再怎么努力，还是不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1016_p", "source_sha256": "9df324b6ec2ad2512da9f106ddacad1bbce68ef091bf0ec203279b202148331c", "ja": "無理というよりは、無謀かもしれないけど。\nでも、無駄な事ではないと思うよ。", "zh": "与其说是不可能，或许更像是有些鲁莽吧。\n不过，我觉得这并不是毫无意义的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1017_p", "source_sha256": "7dfc5377dd50c8e588b043972b8b8ded3a0ead5fec5d1bd88333bafbdf1c2b7f", "ja": "人の心を動かすっていうのは、\nそれだけすごい事だから。", "zh": "打动人心这种事，本身就是非常了不起的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1018_029umi", "source_sha256": "7cc042a5f68f34c5e5c6ed81e82658ec5b8eccfdfa064801fb6c343dfc55f213", "ja": "う、う～ん？　{$P$}……\nますます、わかんなくなってきちゃった～！？", "zh": "唔、唔～？　{$P$}……\n我越来越搞不懂了～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f88eba50b79d2c2d54bb0580a612b0b5ba9867b9b7871da1875e604961d727fc", "ja": "あはは……。あまり考えなくても大丈夫だよ。\n海美は海美らしく、まっすぐ突き進もうって事だ！", "zh": "啊哈哈……不用想得太复杂也没关系。\n意思就是海美只要保持自己的风格，勇往直前就行了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "d949e775744cd15490dd8a0fa0659570ad6dba960be874f5bf6183b6ef7301b5", "ja": "あっ、それでいいんだ！？\nだったら任せて！　私、得意中の得意だから☆", "zh": "啊，原来这样就行了！？\n那就交给我吧！这可是我最擅长的事了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_029umi0493_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_029umi0493_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "d78e5545277ad13d3390ec43d7300a0edc587d69717852007e72752b288a2fca", "ja": "私は私らしく……うん！　なんかスッキリしたかも！\n{$P$}、ありがとーっ！", "zh": "做我自己……嗯！感觉好像一下子轻松多了！\n{$P$}，谢谢你——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
